## 1. Introduction

TechWave Solutions, Inc., a leading provider of cloud-based enterprise solutions, has experienced significant growth in recent years. To support this growth, it is imperative to assess our IT infrastructure, network capabilities, server management, and cybersecurity posture. This report aims to provide a detailed analysis of these components and recommend strategic enhancements.

