Each system is maintained by dedicated teams: the ERP team led by **Maria Chen**, the CRM team under **James Patel**, and the HRMS team directed by **Emily Zhang**.

### 2.2 Network Architecture

The network infrastructure comprises a combination of on-premises and cloud-based resources. Key components include:

